OL,3,GNEWSAAward-winning farming attraction
OL,4,Aput up for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than a quarter of a century,
OL,7,FRichard Powell and Martyn Hughes have
OL,8,Fwelcomed families through the gates of
OL,9,FPark Hall Countryside Experience.
OL,11,FThey have watched children grow up,
OL,12,Freturn as adults and then bring their
OL,13,Fown children through the doors.
OL,15,FNow, after 26 years, the pair have
OL,16,Fdecided it is time for somebody else to
OL,17,Ftake the attraction forward.
OL,19,FThe farmers set up the attraction near
OL,20,FOswestry in 2000 with a simple aim: To
OL,21,Fgive children a better understanding of
OL,22,Ffarming and the countryside.
